            {
                "entry_id": "9ffba8e6-24d4-356e-b1ca-8fa0fe90ae25",
                "word": "arvo",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "8d357033-9db2-454e-a95e-b720851f63e2",
                        "entry_id": "9ffba8e6-24d4-356e-b1ca-8fa0fe90ae25",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "arvos"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "135fc6f7-c0d7-375f-be36-f23a101da7aa",
                        "entry_id": "9ffba8e6-24d4-356e-b1ca-8fa0fe90ae25",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Afternoon."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Australia",
                            "New-Zealand",
                            "informal"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4e9b5139-c65e-407c-b15e-e10e2264fb2e",
                                "sense_id": "135fc6f7-c0d7-375f-be36-f23a101da7aa",
                                "text": "“Rope and tomahawk,” explained Col. “We put them here this arvo when I came down and whistled first time.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fcdaf8b2-f6b0-49d5-b8e1-64dc9e117e89",
                                "sense_id": "135fc6f7-c0d7-375f-be36-f23a101da7aa",
                                "text": "The usual reaction of a footsoldier observing such incidents is well summed up by the comments of Private Derrick in the Salient at Tobruk: ‘Seen a human side of the war yesterday arvo Red Cross partys [sic] burying dead & treating wounded one of our partys were fired on by enemy & I will always remember it’.⁵⁰"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bcb918d0-e65c-48cc-9e8f-1454ba37566f",
                                "sense_id": "135fc6f7-c0d7-375f-be36-f23a101da7aa",
                                "text": "‘We'll fly you out at seven this arvo—but bring them down a little early, just in case we need to think of something else.’"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "339113fe-ff7d-4092-aeaa-b627c3bd6642",
                                "sense_id": "135fc6f7-c0d7-375f-be36-f23a101da7aa",
                                "text": "“Yeah, he only works on a Saturday arvo,” Kelly told her. “I think the place is packed on that day, because girls come from everywhere just to get a glimpse of him. He's hot as.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8c3c7d8a-96fa-487c-add5-ac7a3d695b16",
                        "source_entry_id": "9ffba8e6-24d4-356e-b1ca-8fa0fe90ae25",
                        "source_sense_id": "135fc6f7-c0d7-375f-be36-f23a101da7aa",
                        "source_sense_description": "afternoon",
                        "target_lang_word": "aprèm",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "aprèm",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9c53c03b-4562-328e-99de-d8acc3e2cefe",
                                        "entry_id": "d2fd4c81-0680-3082-9fa0-0b78c275dd13",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Après-midi."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "familiar"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c9211772-3a47-412a-af30-95c9aea6efeb",
                                                "sense_id": "9c53c03b-4562-328e-99de-d8acc3e2cefe",
                                                "text": "— Il a dit, l’capitaine, que j’passerais à la tondeuse c’t’ aprèm’…"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "946db48c-f4e8-4f6d-a2a3-23c41a10006d",
                                                "sense_id": "9c53c03b-4562-328e-99de-d8acc3e2cefe",
                                                "text": "Pas grand-chose qui touche les devoirs, le mardi après-midi on a natation et ils vous mettent dans une salle de classe pour le reste de l’aprèm, le mercredi après-midi on a sport et il y a plus que le jeudi et le vendredi pour travailler, si on peut dire que c’est du travail."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5c763021-9d8e-4f99-84d4-f07c843135b2",
                                                "sense_id": "9c53c03b-4562-328e-99de-d8acc3e2cefe",
                                                "text": "Dans le creux de l’aprèm, un engourdissement diffus s’emparait de la cité."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "992e987c-b1cf-4884-90a2-228b27509fa3",
                        "source_entry_id": "9ffba8e6-24d4-356e-b1ca-8fa0fe90ae25",
                        "source_sense_id": "135fc6f7-c0d7-375f-be36-f23a101da7aa",
                        "source_sense_description": "afternoon",
                        "target_lang_word": "Nachmittag",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Nachmittag",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "60db1462-a603-3b2e-ad62-a5022a02a3c7",
                                        "entry_id": "60e21b15-3c35-3db0-b274-1009be644181",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "die Zeit vom Mittag bis zum Abend"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "74847c6c-6422-4a99-b9fc-63e3060e60e3",
                                                "sense_id": "60db1462-a603-3b2e-ad62-a5022a02a3c7",
                                                "text": "Unser Flug startet am Nachmittag."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d93fba9e-5db4-444a-96e2-954167d7b7f9",
                                                "sense_id": "60db1462-a603-3b2e-ad62-a5022a02a3c7",
                                                "text": "„Endlich, am späten Nachmittag, kamen Flugzeuge, einige Spitfire und Mustangs, die aus Richtung Flensburg oder Schleswig hereindrehten, um im Tiefflug über uns hinwegzuflitzen und auf die Nordsee hinaus zu verschwinden.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "568e0c89-a4f1-4573-a029-b316d870e033",
                                                "sense_id": "60db1462-a603-3b2e-ad62-a5022a02a3c7",
                                                "text": "„Wir landeten am späten Nachmittag in einer kleinen sandigen Bucht.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "891a48c0-c6be-41e9-aaca-fa00a80baa80",
                                                "sense_id": "60db1462-a603-3b2e-ad62-a5022a02a3c7",
                                                "text": "„Es ging dann schon auf den Nachmittag zu, und ich hatte nun auch etwas Hunger.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1bb69aa5-972d-49d0-8431-556a123c7e2f",
                                                "sense_id": "60db1462-a603-3b2e-ad62-a5022a02a3c7",
                                                "text": "„Eines Nachmittags saß ich bei offenem Fenster in meiner Bücherstube.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
